(MIT, The Pierre Computer Company) by scripts/icons/generate.ts, which is modelled on
pierrecomputer/pierre packages/trees/scripts/generate-built-in-icons.ts (Apache-2.0).

The `claude` file icon is the Codicons `claude` icon, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation,
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC-BY-4.0),
https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-codicons. The mark it depicts belongs to Anthropic.

File icons for audio, video, PDF, Java, Kotlin and the other types listed in
scripts/icons/rules.ts (CATPPUCCIN_RULES) come from Catppuccin's vscode-icons (MIT,
https://github.com/catppuccin/vscode-icons), through @iconify-json/catppuccin, recoloured onto
this project's icon hues.
